<title>UK: LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</title>
<headline>LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Reuter - Following are the buying and selling rates for leading world currencies and gold against the dollar on the London foreign exchange and bullion markets today.</p>
<p>US$1.00 COSTS    1.3821/26 Canadian Dollars</p>
<p>		     1.7018/23 German Marks</p>
<p>		     1.9150/60 Dutch Guilders</p>
<p>		     1.4138/48 Swiss Francs</p>
<p>		     35.13/17  Belgian Francs</p>
<p>		     5.7521/41   French Francs</p>
<p>		     1690.8/1.8  Italian Lire</p>
<p>		     116.37/47   Japanese Yen</p>
<p>		     7.7291/66   Swedish Crowns</p>
<p>		     7.0969/42   Norwegian Crowns</p>
<p>		     6.4810/30   Danish Crowns</p>
<p>One Sterling     US$1.6374/84</p>
<p>Gold (ounce)     US$345.40/80</p>
</text>
